      "id": 43,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Packet rate",
      "description": "rate(incus_network_receive_packets_total[5m]) and rate(incus_network_transmit_packets_total[5m]) per guest and interface, transmit drawn negative. Packet rate against byte rate distinguishes a chatty small-message workload from a bulk-transfer one, which is the interesting difference between the queue engines.",
