    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Network errors and drops",
      "description": "Rates of incus_network_receive_errs_total, transmit_errs_total, receive_drop_total and transmit_drop_total per guest, summed across interfaces. Any sustained non-zero value here means the bench's own network is losing traffic and latency figures from that window are suspect.",
